  - id: ch1-ex-02
    type: single-choice
    lessonId: 
    topic: 
    difficulty: 2
    tags: []
    source: GT 2021, tr. 11
    chapterId: tthcm-ch1
    prompt: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \"v\u1EC1 ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c\" c\u1EE7a Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 1 l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    explanation: "Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 1 g\xF3p ph\u1EA7n trang b\u1ECB cho sinh vi\xEAn nh\u1EEFng ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 chung (nh\u1EADp m\xF4n) c\u1EE7a m\xF4n h\u1ECDc."
    promptVN: "M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \"v\u1EC1 ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c\" c\u1EE7a Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 1 l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    explanationVN: "Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 1 g\xF3p ph\u1EA7n trang b\u1ECB cho sinh vi\xEAn nh\u1EEFng ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 chung (nh\u1EADp m\xF4n) c\u1EE7a m\xF4n h\u1ECDc."
    options:
    - id: A
      text: "Trang b\u1ECB ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 chung (nh\u1EADp m\xF4n) c\u1EE7a m\xF4n h\u1ECDc T\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh"
      textVN: "Trang b\u1ECB ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n v\u1EC1 m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 chung (nh\u1EADp m\xF4n) c\u1EE7a m\xF4n h\u1ECDc T\u01B0 t\u01B0\u1EDFng H\u1ED3 Ch\xED Minh"
      side: 
    - id: B
      text: "H\u1ECDc to\xE0n b\u1ED9 l\u1ECBch s\u1EED th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi"
      textVN: "H\u1ECDc to\xE0n b\u1ED9 l\u1ECBch s\u1EED th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi"
      side: 
    - id: C
      text: "H\u1ECDc c\xE1c ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE1p k\u1EBF to\xE1n"
      textVN: "H\u1ECDc c\xE1c ph\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE1p k\u1EBF to\xE1n"
      side: 
    - id: D
      text: "H\u1ECDc l\u1EADp tr\xECnh"
      textVN: "H\u1ECDc l\u1EADp tr\xECnh"
